{
  "_comment": "A fight from the conquest map, run like a Cult of the Lamb dungeon: layers of rooms, each a shape (shapes: a union of circles {c: [x, z, r]} and rectangles {r: [x, z, w, h]} centred on 0,0; shapeFor picks one per room kind; roomW x roomH is the old box, kept for hand-made layouts without a shape). You come in on one side; once the room is done, a door per room of the next layer opens on the other sides (north first, then west/east) and you walk a corridor (corridor tiles) into the next room, laid out beside the last. Room kinds: fight, elite (a shield-bearer plus tougher critters), treasure (pick one of two blessings for the rest of the run), rest (a campfire heals), boss; after the last layer an exit door ends the run. ai: chase (winds up and lunges to bite: bite.*), ranged (keeps its distance, winds up, shoots), shield (blocks claws from the front, winds up a lunge, then is exposed), boss (charge, bag volley, whistles for help at summonAt hp fractions). size = billboard width in tiles (default 1.6). Night: every critter +1 hp, one more pickup per room. Speeds in tiles/s, times in seconds. Roll: chain up to three (press again within roll.chainWindow after one ends); the third is a long pounce (roll.third) followed by roll.cooldown. A shield turns at shield.turnRate rad/s and not at all while staggered or attacking; a claw from behind does +1 and staggers it for shield.staggerSec. Your claw: a 3-hit combo, the third a heavy hit (attack.heavy adds damage, knockback, a longer lunge and recovery); every landed hit freezes the action for attack.hitStop seconds (light, heavy). Specials (crypt critters, regions.json specials): one may join a fight room from specials.fromLayer on (chance, eliteChance). wisp = wickling (keeps away, homing flame, blinks every blinkEvery hits), bones = bone rat (chase; first knock-out leaves a pile for bones.downSec that one hit smashes, else it stands up), swoop = bell bat (orbits, rings, dives through), burrow = digger (claws can't reach the mound; it rumbles, bursts up hurting within burrow.reach, then sits dazed), gloom (slow, goo slows you to gloom.gooSlow, slam hits within gloom.reach, splits into two gloomlets). fly: ignores stumps. pickupReach: walk this close to loot to grab it. cardReach: stand this close to a blessing card to read it (E takes it, Esc leaves it). layoutChance: how often a fight/elite room uses one of the region's hand-made layouts (data/rooms.json, made with the level editor) when it has any; a boss room always does. Boss moves (enemies.<boss>.moves, cycled in order; default charge, volley): charge (runs you down, dazed on a wall), volley (a spread of bags), slam (howls/plunges: hurts within boss.slamReach after boss.slamWindup, then rests boss.slamRecover), hop (leaps to where you stood, lands with a slam and a goo puddle), burrow (tunnels under you for boss.burrowSec, unclawable, rumbles boss.burrowWindup, bursts up within slamReach).",
